      "standardized_narrative": "Syndicate 1414 opened 2019 with gross claims outstanding of GBP 902.6m. During 2019 the syndicate recorded a prior-accident-year run-off deficit of GBP 18.5m (an adverse reserve strengthening of c.2.05% of opening gross claims), driven by adverse prior-year development primarily from large losses and prior catastrophe events (notably Typhoon Jebi and the California wildfires/Camp wildfire), together with several large 2019 large risk losses (e.g. Star Centurion, Deer Park, Jim Beam, Badr). The net prior-year deficit comprised a GBP 22.8m adverse movement on reinsurance acceptance (treaty) business partially offset by a GBP 4.3m release on direct business.",
